                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Rating: 7.8/10\n\nRussian Roads is a budget off-road driving simulator that focuses on navigating rough terrain, muddy tracks, and challenging country roads using classic Russian vehicles. While it lacks the polish and content of larger racing simulators, it offers a surprisingly enjoyable experience for players who appreciate simple off-road driving and vehicle upgrades. With its low price and straightforward gameplay, it's a decent choice for casual racing fans.",
